  "translations": {
    "translations": [
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "FR",
        "iso_639_1": "fr",
        "name": "Français",
        "english_name": "French",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "https://www.gaumont.com/fr/film/laffaire-marie-claire",
          "overview": "Novembre 1972. Au tribunal de Bobigny, un procès hors norme secoue la France entière. Marie-Claire Chevalier, 16 ans, est accusée d’avoir avorté illégalement. À la barre, sa mère et toutes les femmes qui l’ont aidée. Leur avocate, Gisèle Halimi, fait un pari fou, insensé : elle leur demande de ne pas plaider coupable. Gisèle va faire ce qui n’a jamais été fait auparavant, elle va accuser et attaquer la loi, au risque de tout perdre. Au nom de toutes.",
          "runtime": 102,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": ""
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "US",
        "iso_639_1": "en",
        "name": "English",
        "english_name": "English",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "1972. A landmark trial shakes France as young Marie-Claire is prosecuted for having an illegal abortion with the help of her mother and two other defendants. In a courtroom governed by men, the verdict seems inevitable: prison for the women, while the rapist goes unpunished. Their last hope lies with Gisèle Halimi, a fearless lawyer known for openly challenging patriarchy and confronting the system that condemns victims and lets perpetrators walk free. Alongside the accused, Gisèle will not only change their fate, but, against all odds, transform the condition of women forever",
          "runtime": 102,
          "tagline": "1972 - The trial that changed everything.",
          "title": "Women on Trial"
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "KR",
        "iso_639_1": "ko",
        "name": "한국어/조선말",
        "english_name": "Korean",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "",
          "runtime": 0,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "지젤"
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "CN",
        "iso_639_1": "zh",
        "name": "普通话",
        "english_name": "Mandarin",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "1972年11月，在沸腾的博比尼法庭上，一场历史性审判震撼了法国社会。法庭审理的是玛丽-克莱尔·舍瓦利耶一案，这位16岁的少女在母亲的协助下非法堕胎。她们的律师吉泽尔·哈利米不为两名堕胎“罪犯”辩护，而是将这场诉讼作为对一条极不公正的法律的控诉。",
          "runtime": 0,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "玛丽-克莱尔事件"
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "BR",
        "iso_639_1": "pt",
        "name": "Português",
        "english_name": "Portuguese",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "Novembro de 1972. Um julgamento histórico no tribunal de Bobigny mobiliza a França. Marie-Claire Chevalier, de 16 anos, é acusada de realizar um aborto ilegal. Sua mãe e as mulheres que a ajudaram também vão a julgamento. A advogada, Gisèle Halimi, assume um risco inédito: em vez de declarar suas clientes culpadas, coloca a própria lei no banco dos réus, desafiando o sistema e arriscando tudo.",
          "runtime": 102,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "O Caso Marie-Claire"
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "HK",
        "iso_639_1": "zh",
        "name": "普通话",
        "english_name": "Mandarin",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "1972年，一場震驚法國的審判正式展開——年輕的瑪莉–克萊(Marie-Claire)在母親與另外兩名被告的協助下進行非法墮胎，因而遭到起訴。在由男性絕對主導的法庭裡，審判結果似乎早已毫無懸念：女人注定面臨牢獄之災，強姦犯卻能逍遙法外。她們最後的希望，全寄託在無畏的辯護律師吉賽爾·哈利米(Gisèle Halimi)身上。她以公開撕破父權面具、正面對抗「譴責受害者、放縱罪犯」的腐敗體制而聞名。這一次，吉賽爾將與受害者並肩作戰。她們不僅要扭轉自身命運，更要在重重逆境中擊碎不公，永遠徹底改變所有女性的處境！",
          "runtime": 0,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "瑪麗-克萊爾事件"
        }
      }
    ]
  },
